#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:4
msgid "OpenSearch"
msgstr "OpenSearch"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:6
msgid ""
"OpenSearch provides log aggregation, metrics storage, and full-text "
"search for |morpheus|. This page covers setting up and configuring "
"OpenSearch when running it as an external or distributed service."
msgstr "OpenSearch fournit l'agrégation des journaux, le stockage des métriques et la recherche en texte intégral pour |morpheus|. Cette page couvre la configuration d'OpenSearch lorsqu'il est exécuté en tant que service externe ou distribué."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:8
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Note"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:10
msgid ""
"For HVM deployments and all-in-one installations, OpenSearch is embedded "
"and requires no configuration. This page is only relevant when running "
"OpenSearch externally or in a multi-node embedded cluster."
msgstr "Pour les déploiements HVM et les installations tout-en-un, OpenSearch est intégré et ne nécessite aucune configuration. Cette page n'est pertinente que lors de l'exécution d'OpenSearch en externe ou dans un cluster intégré multi-nœuds."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:13
msgid "Settings Reference"
msgstr "Référence des paramètres"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:15
msgid ""
"The following settings control OpenSearch behavior. They can be set in "
"``/etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb`` under the ``opensearch[...]`` namespace (or"
" the legacy ``elasticsearch[...]`` namespace — values are bridged "
"automatically, with ``opensearch[...]`` taking precedence)."
msgstr "Les paramètres suivants contrôlent le comportement d'OpenSearch. Ils peuvent être définis dans ``/etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb`` sous l'espace de noms ``opensearch[...]`` (ou l'espace de noms hérité ``elasticsearch[...]`` — les valeurs sont transférées automatiquement, ``opensearch[...]`` ayant la priorité)."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:21
msgid "Setting"
msgstr "Paramètre"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:22
msgid "opensearch.yml Mapping"
msgstr "Mappage opensearch.yml"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:23
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "Objectif"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:24
msgid "``enable``"
msgstr "``enable``"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:25
#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:46
#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:49
#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:52
msgid "—"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:26
msgid ""
"Enable/disable the embedded OpenSearch service. Set to ``false`` when "
"using an external cluster. Default ``true``."
msgstr "Activer/désactiver le service OpenSearch intégré. Définissez sur ``false`` lors de l'utilisation d'un cluster externe. Par défaut ``true``."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:27
msgid "``es_hosts``"
msgstr "``es_hosts``"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:28
msgid "``cluster.initial_master_nodes``, ``discovery.seed_hosts``"
msgstr "``cluster.initial_master_nodes``, ``discovery.seed_hosts``"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:29
msgid ""
"Cluster membership and discovery. For external clusters, lists the "
"external hosts."
msgstr "Appartenance au cluster et découverte. Pour les clusters externes, liste les hôtes externes."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:30
msgid "``node_name``"
msgstr "``node_name``"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:31
msgid "``node.name``"
msgstr "``node.name``"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:32
msgid "Unique name for this node within the cluster."
msgstr "Nom unique pour ce nœud au sein du cluster."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:33
msgid "``host``"
msgstr "``host``"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:34
msgid "``network.host`` or ``network.bind_host``"
msgstr "``network.host`` ou ``network.bind_host``"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:35
msgid ""
"Interface to bind to. Default ``127.0.0.1``. Set to ``0.0.0.0`` for "
"cluster use."
msgstr "Interface à laquelle se lier. Par défaut ``127.0.0.1``. Définissez sur ``0.0.0.0`` pour une utilisation en cluster."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:36
msgid "``publish_ip``"
msgstr "``publish_ip``"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:37
msgid "``network.publish_host``"
msgstr "``network.publish_host``"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:38
msgid ""
"The IP other nodes use to reach this node. Falls back to Ohai's "
"``node['ipaddress']`` if not set."
msgstr "L'adresse IP que les autres nœuds utilisent pour atteindre ce nœud. Revient à ``node['ipaddress']`` d'Ohai si non défini."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:39
msgid "``secure_mode``"
msgstr "``secure_mode``"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:40
msgid "``plugins.security.disabled: false``, TLS config"
msgstr "``plugins.security.disabled: false``, configuration TLS"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:41
msgid ""
"Enables TLS on HTTP and transport layers, generates certs, runs "
"securityadmin.sh."
msgstr "Active TLS sur les couches HTTP et transport, génère des certificats, exécute securityadmin.sh."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:42
msgid "``cluster``"
msgstr "``cluster``"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:43
msgid "``cluster.name``"
msgstr "``cluster.name``"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:44
msgid "Cluster name. Defaults to ``morpheus``. Must be the same on all nodes."
msgstr "Nom du cluster. Par défaut ``morpheus``. Doit être identique sur tous les nœuds."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:45
msgid "``use_tls``"
msgstr "``use_tls``"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:47
msgid ""
"Connect to OpenSearch over HTTPS. Automatically set to ``true`` when "
"``secure_mode`` is enabled on the embedded service. Set manually for "
"external TLS clusters."
msgstr "Se connecter à OpenSearch via HTTPS. Automatiquement défini sur ``true`` lorsque ``secure_mode`` est activé sur le service intégré. Définissez manuellement pour les clusters TLS externes."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:48
msgid "``auth_user``"
msgstr "``auth_user``"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:50
msgid ""
"Username for |morpheus| to authenticate with OpenSearch. Used for "
"external clusters. When nil and ``secure_mode`` is enabled, the auto-"
"created ``morpheus`` internal user is used."
msgstr "Nom d'utilisateur pour que |morpheus| s'authentifie auprès d'OpenSearch. Utilisé pour les clusters externes. Lorsqu'il est nil et que ``secure_mode`` est activé, l'utilisateur interne ``morpheus`` auto-créé est utilisé."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:51
msgid "``auth_password``"
msgstr "``auth_password``"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:53
msgid "Password for ``auth_user``. Used for external clusters."
msgstr "Mot de passe pour ``auth_user``. Utilisé pour les clusters externes."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:54
msgid "``replica_count``"
msgstr "``replica_count``"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:55
msgid "``numberOfReplicas``"
msgstr "``numberOfReplicas``"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:56
msgid ""
"Number of index replicas. Default ``1``. Set to ``0`` for single-node "
"deployments."
msgstr "Nombre de réplicas d'index. Par défaut ``1``. Définissez sur ``0`` pour les déploiements à nœud unique."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:57
msgid "``admin_dn``"
msgstr "``admin_dn``"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:58
msgid "``plugins.security.authcz.admin_dn``"
msgstr "``plugins.security.authcz.admin_dn``"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:59
msgid ""
"Distinguished name for the admin certificate. Defaults to "
"``O=Morpheus,OU=Ops,CN=<node_name>``."
msgstr "Nom distinctif du certificat administrateur. Par défaut ``O=Morpheus,OU=Ops,CN=<node_name>``."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:60
msgid "``nodes_dn``"
msgstr "``nodes_dn``"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:61
msgid "``plugins.security.nodes_dn``"
msgstr "``plugins.security.nodes_dn``"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:62
msgid ""
"Distinguished name for trusted node certificates. Defaults to "
"``O=Morpheus,OU=Ops,CN=<node_name>``."
msgstr "Nom distinctif des certificats de nœud approuvés. Par défaut ``O=Morpheus,OU=Ops,CN=<node_name>``."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:65
msgid "Ports"
msgstr "Ports"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:67
msgid "Ensure the following ports are open between all OpenSearch cluster nodes:"
msgstr "Assurez-vous que les ports suivants sont ouverts entre tous les nœuds du cluster OpenSearch :"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:69
msgid "**9200** — HTTP (client queries)"
msgstr "**9200** — HTTP (requêtes client)"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:70
msgid "**9300** — Transport (inter-node communication and cluster formation)"
msgstr "**9300** — Transport (communication inter-nœuds et formation du cluster)"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:73
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "Notes"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:75
msgid ""
"You can use either ``elasticsearch[...]`` or ``opensearch[...]`` keys in "
"``morpheus.rb``. The ``elasticsearch`` keys are bridged to ``opensearch``"
" automatically. If the same key is set under both namespaces, the "
"``opensearch[...]`` value takes precedence."
msgstr "Vous pouvez utiliser les clés ``elasticsearch[...]`` ou ``opensearch[...]`` dans ``morpheus.rb``. Les clés ``elasticsearch`` sont transférées vers ``opensearch`` automatiquement. Si la même clé est définie sous les deux espaces de noms, la valeur ``opensearch[...]`` a la priorité."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:76
msgid ""
"The reconfigure strips ``127.0.0.1`` from ``es_hosts`` when more than one"
" host is present, so you don't need to exclude it."
msgstr "La reconfiguration supprime ``127.0.0.1`` de ``es_hosts`` lorsque plus d'un hôte est présent, vous n'avez donc pas besoin de l'exclure."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:77
msgid ""
"In secure mode, ``admin_dn`` and ``nodes_dn`` default to "
"``O=Morpheus,OU=Ops,CN=<node_name>`` and are set automatically per node. "
"These only need to be overridden when using custom certificates."
msgstr "En mode sécurisé, ``admin_dn`` et ``nodes_dn`` sont par défaut ``O=Morpheus,OU=Ops,CN=<node_name>`` et sont définis automatiquement par nœud. Ils ne doivent être remplacés que lors de l'utilisation de certificats personnalisés."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:80
msgid "Custom Certificates"
msgstr "Certificats personnalisés"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:82
msgid ""
"When using your own certificates instead of the auto-generated ones, set "
"``admin_dn`` and ``nodes_dn`` to match the subject DN of your "
"certificates:"
msgstr "Lors de l'utilisation de vos propres certificats au lieu de ceux générés automatiquement, définissez ``admin_dn`` et ``nodes_dn`` pour correspondre au DN sujet de vos certificats :"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:84
msgid ""
"``admin_dn`` — Identifies the certificate authorized to run "
"administrative operations (e.g., ``securityadmin.sh``). Only requests "
"signed by a certificate matching this DN can modify the security index."
msgstr "``admin_dn`` — Identifie le certificat autorisé à exécuter des opérations administratives (par ex., ``securityadmin.sh``). Seules les requêtes signées par un certificat correspondant à ce DN peuvent modifier l'index de sécurité."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:85
msgid ""
"``nodes_dn`` — Identifies certificates trusted for inter-node transport "
"communication. Nodes will reject transport connections from certificates "
"that don't match."
msgstr "``nodes_dn`` — Identifie les certificats approuvés pour la communication de transport inter-nœuds. Les nœuds rejettent les connexions de transport provenant de certificats qui ne correspondent pas."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:87
msgid "To extract the subject DN from an existing certificate:"
msgstr "Pour extraire le DN sujet d'un certificat existant :"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:89
msgid "openssl x509 -in /path/to/cert.pem -noout -subject -nameopt RFC2253"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:93
msgid "Set the values in ``/etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb`` on each node:"
msgstr "Définissez les valeurs dans ``/etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb`` sur chaque nœud :"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:95
msgid ""
"opensearch['admin_dn'] = 'CN=admin,OU=MyTeam,O=MyOrg'\n"
"opensearch['nodes_dn'] = 'CN=node,OU=MyTeam,O=MyOrg'"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:100
msgid ""
"If the admin and node certificates share the same DN (common when a "
"single wildcard or shared cert is used), both values can be set to the "
"same string."
msgstr "Si les certificats admin et nœud partagent le même DN (courant lorsqu'un certificat wildcard ou partagé unique est utilisé), les deux valeurs peuvent être définies sur la même chaîne."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:103
msgid "Setting the Morpheus User Password"
msgstr "Définition du mot de passe utilisateur Morpheus"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:105
msgid ""
"When ``secure_mode`` is enabled, reconfigure creates an internal "
"OpenSearch user named ``morpheus`` that |morpheus| uses to authenticate. "
"The password is auto-generated and stored in ``/etc/morpheus/morpheus-"
"secrets.json`` under the ``elasticsearch.morpheus_password`` key. No "
"manual configuration is needed in the default case."
msgstr "Lorsque ``secure_mode`` est activé, la reconfiguration crée un utilisateur OpenSearch interne nommé ``morpheus`` que |morpheus| utilise pour s'authentifier. Le mot de passe est généré automatiquement et stocké dans ``/etc/morpheus/morpheus-secrets.json`` sous la clé ``elasticsearch.morpheus_password``. Aucune configuration manuelle n'est nécessaire dans le cas par défaut."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:107
msgid ""
"To set a custom password, add it to ``/etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb`` on each"
" node:"
msgstr "Pour définir un mot de passe personnalisé, ajoutez-le à ``/etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb`` sur chaque nœud :"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:109
msgid "opensearch['morpheus_password'] = 'my-custom-password'"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:114
msgid "Encrypting Passwords"
msgstr "Chiffrement des mots de passe"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:116
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Passwords in ``morpheus.rb`` can be stored in encrypted form using the "
"``ENC{...}`` wrapper. During reconfigure, the recipe detects the ``ENC`` "
"prefix and decrypts the value automatically."
msgstr "Les mots de passe dans ``morpheus.rb`` peuvent être stockés sous forme chiffrée à l'aide de l'encapsuleur ``ENC{...}``. Pendant la reconfiguration, la recette détecte le préfixe ``ENC`` et déchiffre automatiquement la valeur."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:118
msgid "To generate an encrypted string:"
msgstr "Pour générer une chaîne chiffrée :"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:120
msgid "morpheus-ctl get-crypto-string string 'my-custom-password'"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:124
msgid "Use the output in ``morpheus.rb``:"
msgstr "Utilisez la sortie dans ``morpheus.rb`` :"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:126
#, python-brace-format
msgid "opensearch['morpheus_password'] = 'ENC{aBcDeFgHiJkLmNoPqRsTuVwXyZ...}'"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:130
msgid ""
"The encryption uses the appliance's ``encryption_key_suffix`` (from "
"``/etc/morpheus/morpheus-secrets.json``), so the encrypted value is "
"specific to that appliance. All nodes in the cluster share the same "
"secrets file contents."
msgstr "Le chiffrement utilise ``encryption_key_suffix`` de l'appliance (depuis ``/etc/morpheus/morpheus-secrets.json``), donc la valeur chiffrée est spécifique à cette appliance. Tous les nœuds du cluster partagent le même contenu du fichier secrets."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:133
msgid "Single Node (Embedded)"
msgstr "Nœud unique (intégré)"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:135
msgid ""
"A single-node setup uses the embedded OpenSearch service with default "
"settings. No ``morpheus.rb`` changes are required unless enabling secure "
"mode."
msgstr "Une configuration à nœud unique utilise le service OpenSearch intégré avec les paramètres par défaut. Aucune modification de ``morpheus.rb`` n'est requise sauf pour activer le mode sécurisé."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:137
msgid ""
"The embedded OpenSearch service starts automatically after reconfigure. "
"To enable secure mode:"
msgstr "Le service OpenSearch intégré démarre automatiquement après la reconfiguration. Pour activer le mode sécurisé :"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:139
msgid "opensearch['secure_mode'] = true"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:144
msgid "3-Node Embedded Cluster"
msgstr "Cluster intégré à 3 nœuds"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:147
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "Prérequis"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:149
msgid "**Networking:**"
msgstr "**Réseau :**"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:151
msgid ""
"All 3 nodes must be able to reach each other on ports 9200 (HTTP) and "
"9300 (Transport)"
msgstr "Les 3 nœuds doivent pouvoir se joindre mutuellement sur les ports 9200 (HTTP) et 9300 (Transport)"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:152
msgid "Each node needs a stable, routable IP address or resolvable hostname"
msgstr "Chaque nœud a besoin d'une adresse IP stable et routable ou d'un nom d'hôte résolvable"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:153
msgid ""
"Both IP addresses and hostnames are supported in ``es_hosts`` and "
"``publish_ip``"
msgstr "Les adresses IP et les noms d'hôte sont pris en charge dans ``es_hosts`` et ``publish_ip``"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:155
msgid "**Configuration:**"
msgstr "**Configuration :**"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:157
msgid "Each node must have the same ``es_hosts`` hash listing all 3 nodes"
msgstr "Chaque nœud doit avoir le même hachage ``es_hosts`` listant les 3 nœuds"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:158
msgid "A unique ``node_name`` per node"
msgstr "Un ``node_name`` unique par nœud"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:159
msgid "A unique ``publish_ip`` matching that node's routable IP"
msgstr "Un ``publish_ip`` unique correspondant à l'adresse IP routable de ce nœud"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:160
msgid "``host`` set to ``0.0.0.0`` (default ``127.0.0.1`` only listens locally)"
msgstr "``host`` défini sur ``0.0.0.0`` (par défaut ``127.0.0.1`` n'écoute que localement)"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:161
msgid "All nodes must share the same ``cluster`` name (defaults to ``morpheus``)"
msgstr "Tous les nœuds doivent partager le même nom de ``cluster`` (par défaut ``morpheus``)"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:163
msgid "**Example nodes:**"
msgstr "**Exemples de nœuds :**"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:165
msgid "Node 1: ``10.0.0.1`` (morpheus-1)"
msgstr "Nœud 1 : ``10.0.0.1`` (morpheus-1)"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:166
msgid "Node 2: ``10.0.0.2`` (morpheus-2)"
msgstr "Nœud 2 : ``10.0.0.2`` (morpheus-2)"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:167
msgid "Node 3: ``10.0.0.3`` (morpheus-3)"
msgstr "Nœud 3 : ``10.0.0.3`` (morpheus-3)"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:170
msgid "Without Secure Mode"
msgstr "Sans mode sécurisé"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:172
msgid "**Node 1** — ``/etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb``:"
msgstr "**Nœud 1** — ``/etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb`` :"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:174
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"opensearch['es_hosts'] = {'10.0.0.1' => 9200, '10.0.0.2' => 9200, "
"'10.0.0.3' => 9200}\n"
"opensearch['node_name'] = 'morpheus-1'\n"
"opensearch['host'] = '0.0.0.0'\n"
"opensearch['publish_ip'] = '10.0.0.1'"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:181
msgid "**Node 2** — ``/etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb``:"
msgstr "**Nœud 2** — ``/etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb`` :"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:183
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"opensearch['es_hosts'] = {'10.0.0.1' => 9200, '10.0.0.2' => 9200, "
"'10.0.0.3' => 9200}\n"
"opensearch['node_name'] = 'morpheus-2'\n"
"opensearch['host'] = '0.0.0.0'\n"
"opensearch['publish_ip'] = '10.0.0.2'"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:190
msgid "**Node 3** — ``/etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb``:"
msgstr "**Nœud 3** — ``/etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb`` :"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:192
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"opensearch['es_hosts'] = {'10.0.0.1' => 9200, '10.0.0.2' => 9200, "
"'10.0.0.3' => 9200}\n"
"opensearch['node_name'] = 'morpheus-3'\n"
"opensearch['host'] = '0.0.0.0'\n"
"opensearch['publish_ip'] = '10.0.0.3'"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:199
msgid "Run on all three nodes:"
msgstr "Exécutez sur les trois nœuds :"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:201
#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:226
#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:277
msgid "morpheus-ctl reconfigure"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:205
msgid ""
"Nodes can be reconfigured in any order. The cluster will form once all "
"nodes are up and can reach each other."
msgstr "Les nœuds peuvent être reconfigurés dans n'importe quel ordre. Le cluster se formera une fois que tous les nœuds seront opérationnels et pourront se joindre mutuellement."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:208
msgid "With Secure Mode"
msgstr "Avec mode sécurisé"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:210
msgid ""
"Secure mode enables TLS on both the HTTP and transport layers. Each node "
"generates its own node certificate, but all nodes must share the **same "
"root CA**."
msgstr "Le mode sécurisé active TLS sur les couches HTTP et transport. Chaque nœud génère son propre certificat de nœud, mais tous les nœuds doivent partager la **même autorité de certification racine**."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:212
msgid "**Step 1 — Configure and reconfigure Node 1 first**"
msgstr "**Étape 1 — Configurer et reconfigurer le nœud 1 en premier**"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:214
msgid "Node 1 — ``/etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb``:"
msgstr "Nœud 1 — ``/etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb`` :"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:216
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"opensearch['es_hosts'] = {'10.0.0.1' => 9200, '10.0.0.2' => 9200, "
"'10.0.0.3' => 9200}\n"
"opensearch['node_name'] = 'morpheus-1'\n"
"opensearch['host'] = '0.0.0.0'\n"
"opensearch['publish_ip'] = '10.0.0.1'\n"
"opensearch['secure_mode'] = true"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:224
msgid "Run reconfigure on Node 1:"
msgstr "Exécutez la reconfiguration sur le nœud 1 :"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:230
msgid "This generates the root CA and node certificate at:"
msgstr "Cela génère l'autorité de certification racine et le certificat de nœud à :"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:232
msgid "``/opt/morpheus/embedded/opensearch-*/config/root-ca.pem``"
msgstr "``/opt/morpheus/embedded/opensearch-*/config/root-ca.pem``"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:233
msgid "``/opt/morpheus/embedded/opensearch-*/config/root-ca-key.pem``"
msgstr "``/opt/morpheus/embedded/opensearch-*/config/root-ca-key.pem``"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:235
msgid "**Step 2 — Copy the root CA to Nodes 2 and 3**"
msgstr "**Étape 2 — Copier l'autorité de certification racine vers les nœuds 2 et 3**"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:237
msgid ""
"Copy both CA files from Node 1 to the same path on Nodes 2 and 3 "
"**before** running reconfigure on them:"
msgstr "Copiez les deux fichiers CA du nœud 1 vers le même chemin sur les nœuds 2 et 3 **avant** d'exécuter la reconfiguration sur eux :"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:239
msgid ""
"# From Node 1:\n"
"scp /opt/morpheus/embedded/opensearch-*/config/root-ca.pem     "
"node2:/opt/morpheus/embedded/opensearch-*/config/\n"
"scp /opt/morpheus/embedded/opensearch-*/config/root-ca-key.pem  "
"node2:/opt/morpheus/embedded/opensearch-*/config/"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:245
msgid "Set ownership on Nodes 2 and 3:"
msgstr "Définissez la propriété sur les nœuds 2 et 3 :"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:247
msgid ""
"chown morpheus-es:morpheus-es /opt/morpheus/embedded/opensearch-*/config"
"/root-ca*.pem"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:251
msgid "**Step 3 — Configure and reconfigure Nodes 2 and 3**"
msgstr "**Étape 3 — Configurer et reconfigurer les nœuds 2 et 3**"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:253
msgid ""
"Set the same configuration with ``secure_mode = true`` on each node (with"
" the appropriate ``node_name`` and ``publish_ip``), then run ``morpheus-"
"ctl reconfigure``. Each node will skip CA generation (the files already "
"exist) and generate its own node certificate signed by the shared CA."
msgstr "Définissez la même configuration avec ``secure_mode = true`` sur chaque nœud (avec le ``node_name`` et ``publish_ip`` appropriés), puis exécutez ``morpheus-ctl reconfigure``. Chaque nœud ignorera la génération de CA (les fichiers existent déjà) et générera son propre certificat de nœud signé par la CA partagée."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:256
msgid "External Cluster"
msgstr "Cluster externe"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:258
msgid ""
"When using an externally managed OpenSearch (or Elasticsearch) cluster, "
"disable the embedded service and point |morpheus| at the external hosts."
msgstr "Lors de l'utilisation d'un cluster OpenSearch (ou Elasticsearch) géré en externe, désactivez le service intégré et pointez |morpheus| vers les hôtes externes."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:260
msgid ""
"Add the following to ``/etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb`` on each |morpheus| "
"appliance node:"
msgstr "Ajoutez les éléments suivants à ``/etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb`` sur chaque nœud d'appliance |morpheus| :"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:262
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"opensearch['enable'] = false\n"
"opensearch['es_hosts'] = {'os-node1.example.com' => 9200, 'os-"
"node2.example.com' => 9200, 'os-node3.example.com' => 9200}\n"
"opensearch['auth_user'] = 'morpheus'\n"
"opensearch['auth_password'] = 'the-external-cluster-password'"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:269
msgid "If the external cluster uses TLS:"
msgstr "Si le cluster externe utilise TLS :"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:271
msgid "opensearch['use_tls'] = true"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:275
msgid "Then reconfigure:"
msgstr "Ensuite, reconfigurez :"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:281
msgid ""
"The embedded OpenSearch service will not be started. |morpheus| connects "
"directly to the external cluster."
msgstr "Le service OpenSearch intégré ne sera pas démarré. |morpheus| se connecte directement au cluster externe."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:283
msgid "**Notes for external clusters:**"
msgstr "**Notes pour les clusters externes :**"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:285
msgid ""
"``auth_user`` and ``auth_password`` are sent to the external cluster for "
"authentication. These must match a user configured on the external "
"cluster."
msgstr "``auth_user`` et ``auth_password`` sont envoyés au cluster externe pour l'authentification. Ils doivent correspondre à un utilisateur configuré sur le cluster externe."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:286
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``auth_password`` supports the ``ENC{...}`` encrypted format (see "
"Encrypting Passwords above)."
msgstr "``auth_password`` prend en charge le format chiffré ``ENC{...}`` (voir Chiffrement des mots de passe ci-dessus)."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:287
msgid ""
"Do **not** set ``secure_mode`` — that setting controls the embedded "
"service's certificate generation. For external TLS clusters, use "
"``use_tls`` instead."
msgstr "Ne définissez **pas** ``secure_mode`` — ce paramètre contrôle la génération de certificats du service intégré. Pour les clusters TLS externes, utilisez ``use_tls`` à la place."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:288
msgid ""
"``replica_count`` can be adjusted to match the external cluster's "
"topology (default ``1``)."
msgstr "``replica_count`` peut être ajusté pour correspondre à la topologie du cluster externe (par défaut ``1``)."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:289
msgid ""
"|morpheus| supports both OpenSearch and Elasticsearch as the external "
"cluster — no migration is required on the external side."
msgstr "|morpheus| prend en charge OpenSearch et Elasticsearch comme cluster externe — aucune migration n'est requise côté externe."

